      "key": "t7055494a41f32976",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">You can develop a successful trading journey by using regulated brokers, following proven strategies and carefully managing risks. Whether your goal is short-term profit or long-term wealth protection, gold and silver are still effective financial tools.</span>",
