    {
      "key": "tfb047898b764eeee",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">What is Forex Trading?</span></span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-trading-in-dubai-laws-procedures-and-a-guide-for-beginners#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-trading-in-dubai-laws-procedures-and-a-guide-for-beginners"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">¿Qué es el comercio de divisas?</span></span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t1f258153366d59d3",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Forex trading involves the exchange of one currency for another based on changing market prices. Global economic factors including rates of interest, price increases statistics, political stability, and central bank actions all have an impact on these price changes. The forex market works globally and is open throughout the day during the week, allowing participants to monitor and react to market movements in real time.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-trading-in-dubai-laws-procedures-and-a-guide-for-beginners#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-trading-in-dubai-laws-procedures-and-a-guide-for-beginners"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">El comercio de divisas implica el intercambio de una moneda por otra en función de los cambios en los precios del mercado. Los factores económicos globales, incluidas las tasas de interés, las estadísticas de aumento de precios, la estabilidad política y las acciones de los bancos centrales, tienen un impacto en estos cambios de precios. El mercado de divisas funciona globalmente y está abierto durante todo el día durante la semana, lo que permite a los participantes monitorear y reaccionar a los movimientos del mercado en tiempo real.</span>"
    },
    {
